    <title>VOL.39 “我以为订婚很浪漫，结果…” 真实订婚全记录（附花销版）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684993df574f065721a81e73</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684993df574f065721a81e73</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 14:46:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>莹莹在今年的五一假期订婚啦~本期的节目内容主要是她给我们分享一下她的订婚流程、花销、注意事项等等，并且我们也顺便探讨了一些简单的关于婚姻的一些看法，希望给大家一个简单的参考吧！也欢迎大家给更多的建议~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 订婚流程</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>确定订婚的时间、地点、参加的人数、妆造等等</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 订婚花销</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>给亲戚的礼物选择等</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 订婚的注意事项</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>男女双方要给对方准备的具体事物&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 具体物品清単总结</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>根据具体需求定礼品、车子、礼金盒、礼服礼花等等</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>提问：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>订婚前、订婚中、订婚后，会有心情上的变化吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> &nbsp;关于婚姻观的一些看法</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>要看对方的家庭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>选一个本身就很好的人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在爱情里会有牺牲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>耿耿、星河、莹莹</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>片头：剪映-纯音乐 &nbsp;&nbsp;菊次郎的夏天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>片尾：执子之手 &nbsp;宝石GEM/哩哩</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
